    <briefdescription>
<para>Stateless engine for Tensor-Train decomposition (TT-SVD). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><heading level="3">Algorithm (Oseledets 2011, Algorithm 1)</heading>
</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Compute Frobenius norm ‖T‖_F and derive per-step truncation δ = ε/√(d-1)·‖T‖_F.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>For k = 1 … d-1: a. Unfold residual into matrix C of shape (r_{k-1}·n_k) × (n_{k+1}·…·n_d). b. Truncated SVD: C ≈ U Σ Vᵀ, keeping r_k singular values with σᵢ &gt; δ. c. G_k ← reshape(U·diag(Σ)^{1/2}, r_{k-1}, n_k, r_k). d. Residual ← reshape(diag(Σ)^{1/2}·Vᵀ, r_k, n_{k+1}·…·n_d).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>G_d ← residual (shape 1 × n_d × 1 after division by ‖T‖_F or similar).</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><heading level="3">Usage</heading>
</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_tensor_train_decomposer_1aca3484d03b5e465de92a422460dbc171" kindref="member">TensorTrainDecomposer</ref><sp/>decomposer;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">TensorTrainConfig<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.eps<sp/>=<sp/>0.01;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>dense<sp/>6D<sp/>tensor<sp/>of<sp/>shape<sp/>{4,4,4,4,4,4}</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::vector&lt;float&gt;<sp/>dense(4096,<sp/>0.0f);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>…<sp/>fill<sp/>dense<sp/>…</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>[train,<sp/>stats]<sp/>=<sp/>decomposer.decompose(dense,<sp/>{4,4,4,4,4,4},<sp/>cfg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;compression<sp/>ratio:<sp/>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>stats.compression_ratio<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;\n&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
